</span><span class="legend-weekend sun"><i></i> Domenica</span><span class="legend-weekend holiday"><i></i> Festività italiana</span></div>

  <div class="section-card">
    <h3 class="sec-toggle" onclick="toggleSection('secOre')"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i> Ore Straordinario <span class="section-inline-summary" id="oreClosedSummary"><span class="summary-pill ore"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i> Ore anno <strong>0 h</strong></span><span class="summary-pill guadagno"><i class="fa-solid fa-euro-sign"></i> Totale anno <strong>€0,00</strong></span></span><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down sec-chevron" id="secOreChevron"></i></h3>
    <div class="sec-body" id="secOre">

  <div class="rate-box">
    <div class="field">
      <label>Nuova tariffa oraria (€)</label>
      <input type="number" step="0.0001" id="rateInput">
      <button class="btn-sm" onclick="updateRate()" style="margin-top:4px;">Applica da questo mese</button>
    </div>
    <div class="note">
      Applica la nuova tariffa dal 1° del mese selezionato (o corrente) su tutte le ore già inserite e per i mesi a venire.
      <div class="rate-history" id="rateHistoryBox"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="summary">
    <div class="stat"><div class="lbl">Ore totali anno</div><div class="val" id="yearHours">0</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="lbl">Ore ad oggi</div><div class="val" id="yearToDate">0</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="lbl">Media ore/mese</div><div class="val" id="yearAvg">0</div></div>
    <div class="stat rate"><div class="lbl">Tariffa oggi</div><div class="val" id="yearRateDisplay">€0</div></div>
    <div class="stat euro"><div class="lbl">Totale euro anno</div><div class="val" id="yearEuro">€0</div></div>
    <div class="stat rep"><div class="lbl">Ore Rep. anno</div><div class="val" id="yearRep">0</div></div>
    <div class="stat recup"><div class="lbl">Ore Recup. anno</div><div class="val" id="yearRecup">0</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="month-summary" id="monthSummary">
    <div class="stat"><div class="lbl">Ore mese</div><div class="val" id="mfOre">0</div></div>
    <div class="stat rep"><div class="lbl">Rep. mese</div><div class="val" id="mfRep">0</div></div>
    <div class="stat recup"><div class="lbl">Recup. mese</div><div class="val" id="mfRecup">0</div></div>
    <div class="stat euro"><div class="lbl">Euro mese</div><div class="val" id="mfEuro">0</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="chart-card">
    <h3>Andamento annuale (ore per mese)</h3>
    <div class="ch-wrap"><canvas id="yearChart"></canvas></div>
  </div>

  <div class="insight-grid" id="insightsGrid" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <div class="months" id="monthsGrid"></div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-card">
    <h3 class="sec-toggle" onclick="toggleSection('secNotes')"><i class="fa-solid fa-note-sticky"></i> Note <span class="section-inline-summary" id="notesClosedSummary"><span class="summary-pill note empty"><i class="fa-regular fa-note-sticky"></i> <strong>Nessuna nota</strong></span></span><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down sec-chevron" id="secNotesChevron"></i></h3>
    <div class="sec-body" id="secNotes">
      <div class="sub-note" id="notesSub">Note libere per l'anno selezionato (filtrabili per mese).</div>
      <div id="notesList"></div>
      <button class="add-row" onclick="addNote()"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i> Aggiungi nota</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-card">
    <h3 class="sec-toggle" onclick="toggleSection('secFerie')"><i class="fa-solid fa-umbrella-beach"></i> Ferie e Permessi <span class="section-inline-summary" id="ferieClosedSummary"><span class="summary-pill ferie"><i class="fa-solid fa-umbrella-beach"></i> Ferie <strong>0 gg</strong></span><span class="summary-pill recupero"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left"></i> Recupero <strong>0 h</strong></span></span><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down sec-chevron" id="secFerieChevron"></i></h3>
    <div class="sec-body" id="secFerie">
      <div class="sub-note">Residuo, spettanza e usufruito per l'anno selezionato. Il saldo è calcolato fino al mese filtrato (o a fine anno se non filtri).</div>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto;">
      <table class="ferie-table">
        <thead><tr><th></th><th>Ferie Giorni</th><th>Per **</th><th>Semifestività</th><th>Rec/HH DIR.VI</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody id="ferieHeadRows"></tbody>
      </table>
      </div>
      <div class="sub-note" style="margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:6px;">Usufruito per mese (compila il mese che ti interessa):</div>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto;">
      <table class="ferie-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Mese</th><th>Ferie Giorni</th><th>Per **</th><th>Semifestività</th><th>Rec/HH DIR.VI</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody id="ferieMonthRows"></tbody>
      </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-card">
    <h3 class="sec-toggle" onclick="toggleSection('secTicket')"><i class="fa-solid fa-ticket"></i> Ticket <span class="section-inline-summary" id="ticketAnnualSummary"><span class="summary-pill ticket"><i class="fa-solid fa-coins"></i> Accumulato <strong>€0,00</strong></span></span><i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down sec-chevron" id="secTicketChevron"></i></h3>
    <div class="sec-body" id="secTicket">
      <div class="sub-note">Inserisci il valore del singolo ticket. I giorni vengono conteggiati dalle presenze giornaliere quando chiudi ciascun mese.</div>
      <div class="ticket-box">
        <div class="field">
          <label style="font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--txt-muted);letter-spacing:.5px;font-weight:700;">Nuovo valore ticket (€)</label>
          <input type="number" step="0.01" id="ticketRateInput">
          <button class="btn-sm" onclick="updateTicketRate()" style="margin-top:4px;">Applica da oggi</button>
        </div>
        <div class="rate-history" id="ticketHistoryBox"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto;">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Mese</th><th>Giorni presenza</th><th>Valore ticket</th><th>Totale</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody id="ticketRows"></tbody>
      </table>
      </div>
      <div class="ticket-total" id="ticketTotalBox" style="margin-top:14px;">Totale anno: €0.00</div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<div id="repPage" style="display:none;">
  <div class="top">
    <div>
      <h1>Reperibilità</h1>
      <p>Segna i giorni in cui sei stato reperibile. Il totale si calcola da solo.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="actions">
      <button class="btn" onclick="hideRepPage()"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Torna alla dashboard</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="calendar-legend"><span class="legend-weekend sat"><i></i> Sabato</span><span class="legend-weekend sun"><i></i> Domenica</span><span class="legend-weekend holiday"><i></i> Festività italiana</span></div>
  <div class="summary" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);">
    <div class="stat"><div class="lbl">Anno</div><div class="val" id="repYearLabel">-</div></div>
    <div class="stat rep"><div class="lbl">Giorni reperibilità anno</div><div class="val" id="repYearTotal">0</div></div>
    <div class="stat rep"><div class="lbl">Settimane (stima)</div><div class="val" id="repYearWeeks">0</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="months" id="repMonthsGrid"></div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

